<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-low-voltage-brown" category="Crunch" order="110" instrument="guitar" style="Hard Rock">
  <description>Brown-sound rhythm crunch: a non-master 100-watt plexi with the mains voltage dropped all the way, so the power section sags and compresses into a spongy, chewy, saturated crunch. Thick, not fizzy; big riffs and chunky rhythm on the bridge humbucker, with a low plate wash behind.</description>
  <tags><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Hard Rock</tag><tag>Brown Sound</tag><tag>Lead</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Plate Reverb</tag></tags>
